{{- /*
  fish's tab completion for chezmoi: what Tab offers after you type `chezmoi `.
  Homebrew's packages bring their completions with them (fish finds those by
  itself), but install.sh puts chezmoi in ~/.local/bin instead, so chezmoi
  writes its own here with its `completion` template function. fish loads
  ~/.config/fish/completions/chezmoi.fish the first time you complete chezmoi.
  chezmoi rewrites this file on `chezmoi apply` when a newer chezmoi's
  completion differs, so it always matches the installed one.
*/ -}}
{{- completion "fish" -}}
